  "behavior": [
    "Four-protocol request usage parser consumes OpenAI usage-only SSE, Anthropic message_start/message_delta snapshots, Google usageMetadata and Responses terminal usage. Repeated cumulative events overwrite instead of adding.",
    "Anthropic uncached input+cache creation+cache reads form total input. OpenAI cached/reasoning details remain subsets; Google candidates+thoughts form output while reported total is retained. Strict nonnegative integer bounds prevent overflow/coercion.",
    "Versioned usage stays under metadata.usage alongside existing display/attachments and signed native replay. actual next request and serializer equality fixtures prove usage does not enter any of four provider histories.",
    "Chat source0.5 threshold and100000 hard cap trigger utility fallback chain with a known model context limit. Only a valid completed latest round for exact provider/endpoint/protocol/model is eligible; no older count reused after missing/partial/fallback results.",
    "Generation, QPointer and immutable history checks guard utility completion; restored applied usage IDs prevent duplicate compression. Original full history remains available and request preparation injects only the chosen briefing+retained suffix.",
    "ProviderConfig persists optional contextWindowTokens (0 unknown,<=100M). ProviderDialog exposes it and clears it on model/endpoint/protocol changes. Matching discovery catalog limits are resolved per exact model and endpoint; explicit default-model limits do not transfer to another model.",
    "Main and side-chat/queue model chains receive catalog metadata; actual turn hook supplies configured global/preset utility chains. Existing manual compression stays functional.",
    "UtilityService result lookup now associates repeated tool IDs only inside the same assistant/result batch. Its network callbacks are queued and reply/generation-bound to support owner deletion outside Qt backend dispatch."
  ],
